  "description": "GIMNAV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H93 Dy5 N12 O23,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.456-3.752 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.18-114.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy5(eehz)3(eqzl)(μ-CH3O)(μ3-CH3O)2(μ4-O)(CH3OH)]·2CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
